      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>我的静态网站</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"从简洁的静态骨架开始，构建自己的响应式网站。\">\n  <style>\n:root {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  --color-bg: #f6f7fb;\n  --color-surface: #ffffff;\n  --color-text: #20283b;\n  --color-muted: #58647a;\n  --color-accent: #4058c9;\n  --color-border: #dce1ed;\n  --space-1: .5rem;\n  --space-2: 1rem;\n  --space-3: 1.5rem;\n  --space-4: 2.5rem;\n  --radius: 1rem;\n  --content-width: 72rem;\n  --font-body: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n}\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody, h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  background: var(--color-bg);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\nimg { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\nbutton, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; }\na { color: var(--color-accent); text-underline-offset: .2em; }\n:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }\n.container {\n  width: min(100% - var(--space-3) * 2, var(--content-width));\n  margin-inline: auto;\n}\n.site-header { background: var(--color-surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n.header-content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: var(--space-2);\n  padding-block: var(--space-3);\n}\n.brand { font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: var(--color-text); }\nnav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); }\nmain { flex: 1; padding-block: var(--space-4); }\n.grid { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); }\n.card {\n  padding: var(--space-3);\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n}\n.card h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-1); font-size: 1.25rem; }\n.card p { color: var(--color-muted); }\n.site-footer { padding-block: var(--space-3); color: var(--color-muted); }\n@media (min-width: 40rem) {\n  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n}\n@media (min-width: 64rem) {\n  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-content\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"./index.html\">我的网站</a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"#app\">首页</a><a href=\"#credits\">来源与署名</a></nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main class=\"container\" id=\"app\">\n  </main>\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\" id=\"credits\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <p>© 我的网站 · 来源与署名待填写</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
